@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   實作
' chapter:      7-2
' realizes:     FR-09, FR-10, NFR-04, NFR-05, NFR-06
' source:       STT_Whisper/src/（程式碼目錄與 CLI 入口）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依目前 Pipeline stage、checkpoint 與 uploader 邊界重繪
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title AI-Pipeline套件圖
left to right direction

package "CLI entrypoints" as Cli {
  [main.py]
  [batch_main.py]
}
package "orchestration" as Orch {
  [job_manager.py]
  [batch_manager.py]
  [resume_checkpoint.py]
  [run_summary.py]
}
package "media and STT stages" as Media {
  [download / audio]
  [Faster-Whisper]
  [normalization]
}
package "chunk and embedding" as Embed {
  [leaf chunking]
  [optional parent hierarchy]
  [Gemini embedding]
}
package "publication" as Publish {
  [mongodb_uploader.py]
  [parent_mongodb_uploader.py]
  [processing webhook]
}
package "run artifacts" as Artifacts {
  [manifest / checkpoint]
  [JSON / JSONL]
}

Cli ..> Orch : create / resume run
Orch ..> Media : execute stages
Media ..> Embed : normalized transcript
Embed ..> Publish : validated artifacts
Orch ..> Artifacts : save state
Media ..> Artifacts : stage outputs
Embed ..> Artifacts : chunks / embeddings
Publish ..> Artifacts : upload summary

note bottom of Embed
  Parent hierarchy 產物可建立，但 production retrieval gate 仍需
  active data、index/filter 與唯讀 E2E 證據。
end note

@enduml
